        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>吃住篇</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    max-width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #222;\n    padding: 20px 20px 60px 20px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 10px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .author-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .avatar {\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 24px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #2fbf9a;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n  }\n  .sep {\n    margin: 0 10px;\n    color: #ccc;\n  }\n  .intro-block p {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 14px 0;\n  }\n  .icon-emoji {\n    margin-right: 4px;\n  }\n  .highlight {\n    background: #ffe066;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .section-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 30px 0 16px 0;\n  }\n  .section-header .arrow {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .place {\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .place-title {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .place-title .arrow {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .place-line {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #999;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: #fafafa;\n  }\n  .ph-top {\n    top: 815px;\n    right: 0px;\n  }\n  .ph-mid {\n    top: 1095px;\n    right: -10px;\n  }\n  .cursor-mark {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 2px;\n    height: 18px;\n    background: #2b6fe0;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">吃住篇</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"author-row\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\">风</span>\n    <span>风少</span>\n    <span class=\"sep\">|</span>\n    <span>今天创建</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"intro-block\">\n    <p><span class=\"icon-emoji\">🚇</span>吃住大家尽量以地铁站为中心，地铁站附近吃住都很方便，如爱联，吉祥，龙城广场，南联等，如果近的地铁站没有酒店了，就选远一点的，反正地铁都很方便</p>\n    <p><span class=\"icon-emoji\">⚠️</span>下图有大运中心附近的所有地铁站</p>\n    <p>酒店还没定的赶紧定，再晚就没了，深圳维也纳较多，实在没有酒店了场观附近还有几个水疗会所，也可以将就过夜</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-header\"><span class=\"arrow\">▼</span>龙岗商场</div>\n\n  <div class=\"place\">\n    <div class=\"place-title\"><span class=\"arrow\">▼</span>星河cocopark</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">地铁：大运站12号口（14号线、16号线）</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">美食：<span class=\"highlight\">海底捞</span>、胖哥俩肉蟹煲、吴庄等</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"place\">\n    <div class=\"place-title\"><span class=\"arrow\">▼</span>万科里</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">地铁：龙城广场D口（3号线）</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">美食：街边铁桶烤肉、肉祭、八<span class=\"cursor-mark\"></span>合里、原石牛扒</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"place\">\n    <div class=\"place-title\"><span class=\"arrow\">▼</span>仁恒梦广场</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">地铁：愉园C口（16号线）</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">美食：79号渔船、文和友、渝月、</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"place\">\n    <div class=\"place-title\"><span class=\"arrow\">▼</span>万科广场</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">地铁：吉祥站C口（3号线）</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">美食：SHADOW觅、西贝、凑凑火锅、蔡澜港式点心</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"place\">\n    <div class=\"place-title\"><span class=\"arrow\">▼</span>摩尔城</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">地铁：南联B2口（3号线）</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">美食：老碗会、萨莉亚、小龙坎火锅</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"place\">\n    <div class=\"place-title\"><span class=\"arrow\">▼</span>天玑城</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">地铁：南联B2口（3号线）</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">美食：<span class=\"highlight\">海底捞</span>、九毛九、大弗兰</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"place\">\n    <div class=\"place-title\"><span class=\"arrow\">▼</span>龙岗天光城</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">地铁：爱联站D口（3号线）</div>\n    <div class=\"place-line\">美食：悦得闲、先启半步颠小酒馆、农耕记</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder ph-top\">[图标]</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder ph-mid\">[排序图标]</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
